{# enforcement/templates/summary.md.tera — uses sahjhan v0.2.0 render context
   Computes all derived values from the raw event list. #}
# Holtz Convergence Summary

**Project:** {{ protocol.name }} v{{ protocol.version }}
**State:** {{ state.label }}
**Ledger:** {{ ledger_len }} events
**Violations:** {{ violations }}

{# ── Compute finding counts ── #}
{% set finding_count = 0 -%}
{% set resolved_count = 0 -%}
{% set fix_iterations = 0 -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding" %}{% set_global finding_count = finding_count + 1 %}{% endif -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding_resolved" %}{% set_global resolved_count = resolved_count + 1 %}{% endif -%}
{% if e.event_type == "state_transition" and e.fields.command == "fix_commit" %}{% set_global fix_iterations = fix_iterations + 1 %}{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}

## Results

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Total findings | {{ finding_count }} |
| Resolved | {{ resolved_count }} |
| Open at convergence | {{ finding_count - resolved_count }} |
| Perspectives completed | {{ sets.perspective.completed }} / {{ sets.perspective.total }} |
| Fix iterations | {{ fix_iterations }} |
| Protocol violations | {{ violations }} |

## Findings by Severity

{# ── Count findings per severity ── #}
| Severity | Found | Resolved |
|----------|-------|----------|
{% for severity in ["CRITICAL", "HIGH", "MEDIUM", "LOW"] -%}
{% set found = 0 -%}
{% set resolved = 0 -%}
{% set resolved_ids = [] -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding_resolved" %}{% set_global resolved_ids = resolved_ids | concat(with=e.fields.id) %}{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding" and e.fields.severity == severity -%}
{% set_global found = found + 1 -%}
{% if resolved_ids is containing(e.fields.id) %}{% set_global resolved = resolved + 1 %}{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% if found > 0 -%}
| {{ severity }} | {{ found }} | {{ resolved }} |
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}

## Findings by Perspective

{# ── Count findings per perspective ── #}
| Perspective | Found | Resolved |
|-------------|-------|----------|
{% set resolved_ids = [] -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding_resolved" %}{% set_global resolved_ids = resolved_ids | concat(with=e.fields.id) %}{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% for m in sets.perspective.members -%}
{% set found = 0 -%}
{% set resolved = 0 -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding" and e.fields.perspective == m.name -%}
{% set_global found = found + 1 -%}
{% if resolved_ids is containing(e.fields.id) %}{% set_global resolved = resolved + 1 %}{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% if found > 0 -%}
| {{ m.name }} | {{ found }} | {{ resolved }} |
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}

## State History

{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "state_transition" -%}
- {{ e.fields.from }} → **{{ e.fields.to }}** ({{ e.fields.command }}) — {{ e.timestamp }}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}

## Perspective Completion

{% for m in sets.perspective.members -%}
- [{% if m.done %}x{% else %} {% endif %}] {{ m.name }}
{% endfor %}

## Predictions

{# ── Prediction tracking from events ── #}
| ID | Target | Confidence | Outcome | Finding |
|----|--------|------------|---------|---------|
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "prediction" -%}
{% set outcome = "PENDING" -%}
{% set finding_id = "—" -%}
{% for o in events -%}
{% if o.event_type == "prediction_outcome" and o.fields.prediction_id == e.fields.id -%}
{% set_global outcome = o.fields.outcome -%}
{% if o.fields.finding_id %}{% set_global finding_id = o.fields.finding_id %}{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
| {{ e.fields.id }} | {{ e.fields.target }} | {{ e.fields.confidence }} | {{ outcome }} | {{ finding_id }} |
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}

## Justine Findings

{% set justine_count = 0 -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding" and e.fields.id is starting_with("BJ-") -%}
{% set_global justine_count = justine_count + 1 -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% if justine_count > 0 -%}
Justine identified **{{ justine_count }}** independent findings.

| ID | Severity | Perspective | Description |
|----|----------|-------------|-------------|
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding" and e.fields.id is starting_with("BJ-") -%}
| {{ e.fields.id }} | {{ e.fields.severity }} | {{ e.fields.perspective }} | {{ e.fields.description }} |
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% else -%}
No Justine findings recorded for this run.
{% endif %}
